{"title":"2014 USAMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Forty-third <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMO\">USAMO</a></b> was held April 29th and April 30th, 2014. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems\">2014 USAMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">2014 USAMO Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_USAMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition reso